# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Force-include the signed APKs + manifest even though `.gitignore` lists
# `/apk/*`. Railway merges `.gitignore` with this file; a negation here
# re-adds specific files that would otherwise be excluded.
# These files are intentionally NOT tracked by Git (too large), but MUST
# ship to Railway so the backend can serve `/api/enroll/download/:kind`
# and `/api/enroll/version/:kind`.
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
!apk/
!apk/manifest.json
!apk/nox-agent.apk
!apk/nox-admin.apk
